WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Thugs in bandanas threw rocks and bottles at ICE agents on patrol.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.140
Chicago police?

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:07.880
Nowhere to be found.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.480
One woman with a rifle rammed her car into an ICE vehicle, using it as a weapon.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.200
The ICE vehicle was disabled, leaving agents trapped and forced to open fire.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.200
The driver?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.240
Marimar Martinez.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.120
She was flagged last week for doxing agents and posting this, quote, hey to all my gang,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.320
let's F these mother F'ers up.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.480
Don't let them take anyone.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.639
This was the second ramming incident over the weekend.

00:00:32.639 --> 00:00:37.680
The feds tried calling for backup, but Chicago PD was ordered to pull a Benghazi.

